871
00:43:17,094 --> 00:43:17,928
Ajá.

872
00:43:20,472 --> 00:43:21,599
Mira, ahí hay una.

873
00:43:24,059 --> 00:43:25,352
¡Guau!

874
00:43:26,687 --> 00:43:28,606
¡Es una pluma de flamingo!

875
00:43:30,983 --> 00:43:32,526
¡Guau, está increíble!

876
00:44:27,581 --> 00:44:28,999
¡Está increíble!

877
00:44:30,542 --> 00:44:31,669
Gracias.

878
00:44:32,336 --> 00:44:33,921
Siempre nos ayudábamos.

879
00:44:35,172 --> 00:44:36,006
Tú y yo.

880
00:44:37,174 --> 00:44:38,008
Sara…

881
00:44:42,304 --> 00:44:43,138
Te extrañé.

882
00:44:43,639 --> 00:44:44,473
Y yo a ti.

883
00:44:46,141 --> 00:44:48,686
