894
00:46:04,511 --> 00:46:05,471
¡Tú!

895
00:46:05,554 --> 00:46:06,388
Yo.

896
00:46:06,972 --> 00:46:07,848
Oye,

897
00:46:08,515 --> 00:46:10,768
